by the renowned Runwal Developers. It is a residential project situated in Malabar Hill. It is an out-of-the-ordinary Residential development in Malabar Hill, which offers a great serenity for variant people living there. The project offers a perfect combination of modern Apartments along with high-standard contemporary interior fittings. Runwal The Residence is the leading 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and also 4 BHK Apartment. The project is located near schools, colleges, hospitals, shopping malls, grocery stores, and restaurants.\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2020\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹1,35,211/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n1420 - 2163 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?","score":0.9403090319636064,"raw_content":null,"id":"dead82-00"},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_runwal-malabar-malabar-hill_8148.html","title":"Runwal Malabar Malabar Hill Mumbai - PropertyCrow.com","content":"Super Luxury Duplex Apartments Duplex\n\nArea 2890 - 3632 Sq.ft.\n\nPrice Coming Soon\n\nView More\n\nRunwal Malabar Under Construction - Possession June 2032\n\nby Runwal Group\n\n### Runwal Malabar\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK, 5 BHK Duplex Flats\n\nArea Carpet Area: 2400 Sq.ft - 4900 Sq.ft\n\nPrice 33 Cr Onwards\n\nView More\n\nAnita Building Ready to Move in\n\nby a Reputed Developer\n\n### Anita Building\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Flats\n\nArea 1400 Sq.ft Carpet Area\n\nPrice 10.50 Cr\n\nView More\n\nMesacon The South Bay Ready to move in Since Dec 2019\n\nby Mesacon Triumph Developers\n\n### Mesacon The South Bay\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n3 & 4 BHK Aprtment Flats\n\nArea 1549 Sq.ft To 2429 Sq.ft Carpet Area\n\nPrice 12.20 Cr Onwards\n\nView More\n\n## Property Deals [...] Is Runwal Malabar, approved by Banks for Home Loans?\n\nYes, Runwal Malabar is approved by leading banks and financial institutions for home loans. Contact us for assistance with your home loan application.\n\n## Share This Project\n\nSimilar Properties\n\n## Similar Properties in Malabar Hill\n\nHill Park Ready to Move in\n\nby a Reputed Developer\n\n### Hill Park\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Flats\n\nArea 1990 Sq.ft Carpet Area\n\nPrice On Request\n\nView More\n\n36 Babulnath Under Construction and Possession March 2021\n\nby Taksheel Developers\n\n### 36 Babulnath\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK - 3 BHK Apartments Flats\n\nArea 8966 Sq.ft - 1117 Sq.ft\n\nPrice On Request\n\nView More\n\nRunwal Malabar New Launch\n\nby Runwal Group\n\n### Runwal Malabar\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nSuper Luxury Duplex Apartments Duplex [...] Is Runwal Malabar Rera Registered?\n\nYes, It is RERA Registered with Rera Number Coming Soon. You can verify the details on the official RERA website.\n\nWhat are unit options available in Runwal Malabar?\n\nRunwal Malabar offers Super Luxury Duplex Apartments.\n\nWhat is the starting price of Duplex in Runwal Malabar?\n\nThe starting price of Duplex at Runwal Malabar is Coming Soon. Contact us for the latest pricing and offers.\n\nWhen is the Possession of Duplex?\n\nThe expected possession date for Runwal Malabar is New Launch.\n\nWhat are the nearest landmarks?","score":0.9389390322527349,"raw_content":null,"id":"9340f6-01"},{"url":"https://runwalltd.com/updates/runwal-malabar-receives-maharera-registration-pr1170002502441-for-malabar-hill-ultra-luxury-project","title":"Runwal Malabar RERA Registration PR1170002502441 — Malabar Hill","content":"Malabar Hill itself remains a tightly held enclave. As of the September 2025 quarter, Malabar Hill has about ten marketable projects launched by leading developers such as Lodha Group, Birla Estates, and JSW Realty, collectively offering around 176 luxury apartments with nearly 30 still available for sale, with carpet prices ranging between ₹85,000 and ₹1,80,000 per sq ft.\n\n### Runwal Realty's Track Record\n\nRunwal Realty, the brand of Runwal Developers Ltd., has been developing residential, commercial and retail real estate across Mumbai, Mumbai Metropolitan Region and Pune since 1978, and is one of India's leading luxury and lifestyle real estate developers with over 35 delivered projects across key locations in the MMR and Pune regions. [...] Runwal Realty (Runwal Developers Ltd.)\n\nRERA11 Apr 2026\n\n# Runwal Malabar Receives MahaRERA Registration (PR1170002502441) for Malabar Hill Ultra-Luxury Project\n\n## Runwal Malabar Receives MahaRERA Registration\n\nRunwal Realty's ultra-luxury Runwal Malabar project at Malabar Hill, Mumbai has received MahaRERA registration under number PR1170002502441. The project comprises 11 exclusive sky mansions, marking a controlled, low-density entry into one of Mumbai's most constrained luxury markets.\n\n### Project Configuration and Pricing\n\nThe project offers 3BHK simplex and 5BHK duplex residences with pricing starting at ₹33.00 crore. Carpet areas range from 2,400 to 4,900 sq.ft., positioning the development firmly in the ultra-luxury segment where supply has tightened considerably since late 2024. [...] ### Market Dynamics in South Mumbai's Ultra-Luxury Sector\n\nNew luxury offerings in the Malabar Hill area include spacious 4BHK and 5BHK apartments, duplexes, and penthouses, with prices ranging from ₹2.4 crore to an ultra-luxury ₹385 crore for select high-end properties. In a city constrained by geography and extreme scarcity of developable land in legacy precincts like Malabar Hill, supply remains limited and demand from UHNI buyers consistently outstrips availability, with recent market dynamics reflecting a resurgence of ultra-luxury developments in the area and per-square-foot values continuing to strengthen due to enduring prestige and systemic supply constraints.\n\nThe possession date as per RERA number (PR1170002502441) is June 2032.\n\nRelated: RUNWAL MALABAR\n\n← All updates","score":0.9297404351597588,"raw_content":null,"id":"dc5d9a-02"},{"url":"https://soboxpert.com/runwal-malabar-hill","title":"Runwal Malabar Hill | Floor Plan, Photos, Amenities & More",