al residences have been designed more like private sky residences than standard apartment units.\n\nRunwal brings around 41 years of real estate experience and has delivered 148 developments across multiple markets.\n\n## Runwal Malabar Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Runwal Malabar.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\ | Action |\n --- \n| 3 BHK Apartment  2400 Sq. Ft. | ₹ 26.49 Cr | Get Payment Plan |\n| 5 BHK Apartment  4900 Sq. Ft. | ₹ 60.00 Cr | Get Payment Plan |","score":0.92122758154266,"raw_content":null,"id":"ed28b0-05"}],"response_time":2.64,"request_id":"db370c52-61bf-41b9-8605-0a14d57a1b25"}